#: ../../index.rst:3
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "入门"

#: ../../index.rst:6
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "介绍"

#: ../../index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Welcome to the |prodname| Administration Guide. This guide describes "
"administration tasks for |prodname|, the mobile access and secure file "
"sharing solution that focuses on local file server cloud-enablement."
msgstr "欢迎阅读 |prodname| 管理指南。本指南描述了 |prodname| 的管理任务，|prodname| 是一款专注于本地文件服务器云使能的移动访问和安全文件共享解决方案。"

#: ../../index.rst:10
msgid ""
"|prodname| runs on the Windows Server platform and includes client agent "
"software applications for Microsoft Windows, Mac OS X, and Mobile Clients"
" for the Android and Apple iOS operating systems."
msgstr "|prodname| 运行在 Windows Server 平台上，并包括了适用于 Microsoft Windows、Mac OS X 的客户端代理软件应用程序，以及适用于 Android 和 Apple iOS 操作系统的移动客户端。"

#: ../../index.rst:13
msgid ""
"|prodname| includes a client application for Windows File Server, which "
"is named \"Server Agent\". This document is about |prodname| itself, not "
"about the \"Server Agent\"."
msgstr "|prodname| 包含一个用于Windows文件服务器的客户端应用程序，名为“服务器代理”。本文档是关于 |prodname| 本身，而不是关于“服务器代理”。"

#: ../../index.rst:16
msgid "This admin guide is written for |prodname| version |release|"
msgstr "本管理员指南适用于 |prodname| 版本 |release|"

#: ../../index.rst:19
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: ../../index.rst:21
msgid ""
"|prodname| is a mobile access and secure file sharing solution. It "
"differentiates itself from other File Sync and Share solutions by "
"focusing on data security, permission controls and, file server cloud-"
"enablements including data protection and cloud migration. |prodname| "
"surpasses the competition in the following areas:"
msgstr "|prodname| 是一个移动访问和安全文件共享解决方案。它通过专注于数据安全、权限控制以及文件服务器云启用包括数据保护和云迁移，从而区别于其他文件同步和共享解决方案。|prodname| 在以下领域超越竞争对手："

#: ../../index.rst:24
msgid ""
"Maintaining Active Directory, security and NTFS permissions on files and "
"folders."
msgstr "维护Active Directory、安全性和NTFS权限在文件和文件夹上。"

#: ../../index.rst:25
msgid "Providing live time sync-and-share with versioning and revision controls."
msgstr "提供实时同步共享，具有版本控制和修订控制。"

#: ../../index.rst:26
msgid ""
"Providing On-Demand access that honors Read-Only, and Write permissions "
"in Real-Time."
msgstr "提供即时访问，实时尊重只读和写入权限。"

#: ../../index.rst:27
msgid "Mirroring of local network shares for Team Collaboration in the Cloud."
msgstr "本地网络共享在云端的团队协作镜像。"

#: ../../index.rst:28
msgid ""
"Provide drive mapping and file locking functionality for files in the "
"Cloud."
msgstr "为云中的文件提供驱动器映射和文件锁定功能。"

#: ../../index.rst:30
msgid ""
"|prodname| is a software solution built on top of the Microsoft Web "
"Platform. It provides file access and sharing functionality from PCs, "
"Macs, File Servers, Web Browsers, and Mobile Devices. In addition, it "
"also brings data protection and cloud migration features."
msgstr "|prodname| 是一款建立在 Microsoft Web 平台之上的软件解决方案。它提供了从 PC、Mac、文件服务器、网页浏览器和移动设备访问和共享文件的功能。此外，它还带来了数据保护和云迁移特性。"

#: ../../index.rst:32
msgid ""
"The services can be deployed in flexible combinations to meet different "
"needs. There are two primary ways to deploy |prodname|."
msgstr "服务可以灵活组合部署以满足不同需求。部署 |prodname| 有两种主要方式。"

#: ../../index.rst:34
msgid ""
"Deploy the |prodname| server in the same site as the File Servers and "
"Active Directory domain controllers:"
msgstr "将 |prodname| 服务器部署在与文件服务器和Active Directory域控制器相同的站点："

#: ../../index.rst:38
msgid ""
"See also: `File Server Remote Access <https://www.gladinet.com/hybrid-"
"cloud-with-file-server.html>`_"
msgstr "另请参阅：`文件服务器远程访问 <https://www.gladinet.com/hybrid-cloud-with-file-server.html>`_"

#: ../../index.rst:40
msgid ""
"Deploy in a cloud data center, such as Amazon Web Services EC2, Microsoft"
" Azure, or in a Data Center where the Managed Service Provider (MSP) "
"hosts their infrastructure:"
msgstr "在云数据中心部署，例如亚马逊网络服务EC2、微软Azure，或在托管服务提供商（MSP）托管其基础设施的数据中心："

#: ../../index.rst:46
msgid ""
"Please reference the `“Installation Checklist”`__ as well as the "
"`“Installation Guide”`__ for information on how to setup and deploy "
"CentreStack. This guide is focused on the administration of |prodname|."
msgstr "请参考 `“安装清单”`__ 以及 `“安装指南”`__，了解如何设置和部署 CentreStack。本指南重点介绍 |prodname| 的管理。"

#: ../../index.rst:57
msgid ""
"This Administration Guide is for the Self-Hosted |prodname|. For Hosted-"
"CentreStack, please reference the Hosted CentreStack Admin Guide."
msgstr "本管理指南适用于自托管的 |prodname|。对于托管的CentreStack，请参考托管CentreStack管理员指南。"

